  "parsing_res_list": [
    {
      "block_label": "doc_title",
      "block_content": "SUMMARY OF THE PROPOSED RESOLUTION",
      "block_bbox": [
        660,
        356,
        1631,
        417
      ],
      "block_id": 0,
      "block_order": 1,
      "group_id": 0,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          660.0,
          356.0
        ],
        [
          1631.0,
          356.0
        ],
        [
          1631.0,
          417.0
        ],
        [
          660.0,
          417.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "The proposed resolution, which would be implemented through legislation and a binding contractual protocol to be entered into by participating members of the tobacco industry, mandates a total reformation and restructuring of how tobacco products are manufactured, marketed and distributed in the United States:",
      "block_bbox": [
        277,
        462,
        1992,
        692
      ],
      "block_id": 1,
      "block_order": 2,
      "group_id": 1,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          277.0,
          462.0
        ],
        [
          1992.0,
          462.0
        ],
        [
          1992.0,
          692.0
        ],
        [
          277.0,
          692.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(1) by seeking to prevent underage access to, and dramatically reduce underage use of, tobacco products;",
      "block_bbox": [
        281,
        729,
        1953,
        851
      ],
      "block_id": 2,
      "block_order": 3,
      "group_id": 2,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          280.048583984375,
          744.0084838867188
        ],
        [
          1952.0,
          729.0000610351562
        ],
        [
          1952.951416015625,
          834.9915161132812
        ],
        [
          281.0,
          849.9999389648438
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(2) by confirming the Food & Drug Administration\u2019s authority to regulate tobacco products under the Food, Drug and Cosmetic Act, with certain provisions applicable to tobacco products;",
      "block_bbox": [
        278,
        886,
        1980,
        1063
      ],
      "block_id": 3,
      "block_order": 4,
      "group_id": 3,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          278.0,
          886.0
        ],
        [
          1980.0,
          886.0
        ],
        [
          1980.0,
          1063.0
        ],
        [
          278.0,
          1063.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(3) by mandating changes in the corporate culture of tobacco companies;",
      "block_bbox": [
        420,
        1100,
        1712,
        1167
      ],
      "block_id": 4,
      "block_order": 5,
      "group_id": 4,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          420.0,
          1100.0
        ],
        [
          1712.0,
          1100.0
        ],
        [
          1712.0,
          1167.0
        ],
        [
          420.0,
          1167.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(4) by setting national requirements limiting smoking in public places (with State and local governments remaining free to set more stringent requirements);",
      "block_bbox": [
        286,
        1203,
        1947,
        1329
      ],
      "block_id": 5,
      "block_order": 6,
      "group_id": 5,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          284.9495849609375,
          1219.0098876953125
        ],
        [
          1946.0001220703125,
          1202.9998779296875
        ],
        [
          1947.2037353515625,
          1327.8726806640625
        ],
        [
          286.1531982421875,
          1343.8826904296875
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(5) by requiring that the participating members of the tobacco industry pay hundreds of billions of dollars to fund medical research; public education; cessation programs; health-care costs incurred by federal, state and local governments; and federal and state enforcement of the restrictions imposed by the proposed resolution;",
      "block_bbox": [
        287,
        1361,
        1985,
        1596
      ],
      "block_id": 6,
      "block_order": 7,
      "group_id": 6,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          287.0,
          1361.0
        ],
        [
          1985.0,
          1361.0
        ],
        [
          1985.0,
          1596.0
        ],
        [
          287.0,
          1596.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(6) by preserving the rights of individuals to sue the tobacco industry;",
      "block_bbox": [
        424,
        1633,
        1667,
        1698
      ],
      "block_id": 7,
      "block_order": 8,
      "group_id": 7,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          424.0,
          1633.0
        ],
        [
          1667.0,
          1633.0
        ],
        [
          1667.0,
          1698.0
        ],
        [
          424.0,
          1698.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(7) by ensuring that members of the tobacco industry who seek to avoid the strictures of the new regime will be held fully accountable for any injuries their products may cause; and",
      "block_bbox": [
        293,
        1736,
        1998,
        1859
      ],
      "block_id": 8,
      "block_order": 9,
      "group_id": 8,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          292.0580749511719,
          1751.0081787109375
        ],
        [
          1996.999755859375,
          1735.9998779296875
        ],
        [
          1997.941650390625,
          1842.9915771484375
        ],
        [
          293.0,
          1857.9998779296875
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "(8) by establishing a comprehensive regime of federal regulation and federal and state enforcement to implement these requirements.",
      "block_bbox": [
        294,
        1896,
        1958,
        2020
      ],
      "block_id": 9,
      "block_order": 10,
      "group_id": 9,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          292.9705810546875,
          1912.010009765625
        ],
        [
          1957.0,
          1896.000244140625
        ],
        [
          1958.1722412109375,
          2017.843994140625
        ],
        [
          294.142822265625,
          2033.853759765625
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "The principal details follow.",
      "block_bbox": [
        567,
        2066,
        1074,
        2126
      ],
      "block_id": 10,
      "block_order": 11,
      "group_id": 10,
      "block_polygon_points": [
